cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "dataeuropa: Python, Julia and R clients for the data.europa.eu open data portal"
abstract: >-
  Three equivalent clients (Python, Julia and R) for data.europa.eu, the official portal for
  European open data. They search the portal's datasets, list and download their files with
  checksum checks, read tables and geodata (including WFS and OGC API Features services) into
  data frames, and query the portal's SPARQL endpoint.
authors:
